flowchart TD
  accTitle: Android Play metadata commit behavior after merges 139 and 140
  accDescr: The metadata publisher commits an edit with the in-review guard. A successful response completes the commit; a rejected response reports its structured Play error when available.
  publisher["Metadata publisher"] --> request["Commit request: changesInReviewBehavior=ERROR_IF_IN_REVIEW"]
  request --> play["Google Play metadata edit commit"]
  play -->|"success"| complete["Commit completes"]
  play -->|"rejection"| response["Capture response"]
  response --> message{"Non-empty structured error message?"}
  message -->|"yes"| report["Report Play error message"]
  message -->|"no"| fallback["Report no structured error message"]
  validator["Metadata validator"] -. "requires guard; rejects changesNotSentForReview" .-> request
